@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Maintenance Observation, Recovery and Verified Change
start
:Observe service, security, storage, backup or user-reported issue;
:Identify actual environment, revision, affected actor and owner;
:Capture bounded evidence and classify impact;
if (Unsafe access / integrity / service condition?) then (yes)
 :Contain affected activity under the verified runbook;
 :Preserve protected references, recorded outcomes and incident evidence;
 if (Recovery needed?) then (yes)
  :Use compatible rollback or approved isolated-tested recovery;
  :Verify actual records, bytes, Git, authority and pending work;
 endif
else (no)
 :Record scoped defect / update / improvement proposal;
endif
:Identify exact criteria, contracts and regression risks;
:Implement separately authorized bounded correction;
:Verify candidate and follow release / deployment gates;
:Record actual outcome, residual gaps and procedure improvement;
stop
@enduml
